│[39m Choice: 6                                                                                                            [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m                                                                                                                      [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m Try detaching: press Ctrl-A, release it, then d.                                                                     [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m On your host, run discobox ls to find this box, then:                                                                [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m                                                                                                                      [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m   discobox attach BOX                                                                                                [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m                                                                                                                      [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m Replace BOX with its name or identifier. You return to this same menu.                                               [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m Detaching does not stop the box. From your host you can explicitly use:                                              [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m                                                                                                                      [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m   discobox stop BOX                                                                                                  [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m   discobox start BOX                                                                                                 [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m                                                                                                                      [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m Before Continue, a new primary launch shows the menu again. After                                                    [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m Continue, a durable marker skips the tour on later starts of this box.                                               [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m To replay without starting another harness, open a shell and run:                                                    [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m                                                                                                                      [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m   .discobox/scripts/pre-harness --replay                                                                             [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m                                                                                                                      [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m When finished, collect any work, then run on your host:                                                              [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m                                                                                                                      [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m   discobox rm BOX                                                                                                    [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m                                                                                                                      [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m This archives the box. The tour never archives it for you.                                                           [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m                                                                                                                      [38;2;244;92;255m│
│[39m Press Enter to return to the menu.                                                                                   [38;2;244;92;255m│
